label: "Completion is behavior at the promised boundary"
layer: "floor"
statement: >
  Completion is behavior at the promised boundary. Nothing in a deliverable is a
  stub, placeholder, or deferred branch. Not done: "compiles", "structure in
  place", "foundation for later."
